==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|races to the bottom}}

# {{lb|en|economics}} A situation in which [[competition]] between [[government]]s leads to very [[excessive]] ([[harmful]]) [[deregulation]].
# A situation in which [[competition]] between [[entity|entities]] leads to [[elimination]] of [[perk]]s or [[amenity|amenities]], often in the interest of [[cut]]ting [[cost]]s.
# Any situation in which multiple [[party|parties]] are seemingly [[compete|competing]] to achieve the greatest level of [[mediocrity]].

